    {
      "id": "agent_0",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "p2p_router",
      "description": "Reads the buyer message and determines which P2P domain agent to invoke",
      "position": {
        "x": 482.722491866012,
        "y": -91.00000000000003
      },
      "deletable": true,
      "selected": true,
      "dragging": false,
      "data": {},
      "properties": {
        "retryOnFailure": false,
        "maxRetries": 6,
        "retryInterval": 541,
        "errorHandling": "none"
      },
      "config": {
        "agentStrategy": "react",
        "model": {
          "code": "gpt-5-mini",
          "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 mini",
          "vendor": "openai",
          "provider": "azureopenai"
        },
        "promptTemplate": [
          {
            "id": "router-sys-001",
            "role": "system",
            "text": "You are the P2P Router for GEP's Procure-to-Pay AI Agent. Your ONLY job is to read the buyer's message and decide which domain agent should handle it.\n\nThe five domain agents and their exact string values:\n\n| Agent | Value to return | Handles |\n|---|---|---|\n| Catalog Agent | catalogagent | Searching for items, browsing catalog, adding to cart, viewing items, checking prices, creating or flipping a cart |\n| Requisition Agent | requisitionagent | Creating a requisition, setting accounting codes (cost centre, GL account), setting delivery address, submitting for approval, checking req status |\n| Order Agent | orderagent | Creating a Purchase Order, issuing PO to supplier, checking order status |\n| Goods Receipt Agent | goodsreceiptagent | Recording delivery of goods, confirming receipt, reporting short shipment, recording received quantities |\n| Invoice Agent | invoiceagent | Creating an invoice, 3-way match, approving invoice, processing payment, checking invoice status |\n\nRouting rules:\n- If the message is a NEW purchase request (e.g. \"I need 10 laptops\", \"buy me office chairs\", \"order 5 monitors\") → catalogagent\n- If the message mentions requisition, req, approval, cost centre, GL account, accounting → requisitionagent\n- If the message mentions purchase order, PO, supplier, order → orderagent\n- If the message mentions delivery, received, goods receipt, GR, shipment, arrived → goodsreceiptagent\n- If the message mentions invoice, payment, 3-way match, billing, pay → invoiceagent\n- When in doubt for a new purchase request → always default to catalogagent\n\nYou MUST respond with ONLY a JSON object — nothing else, no explanation, no preamble:\n{\n  \"agentName\": \"<one of: catalogagent | requisitionagent | orderagent | goodsreceiptagent | invoiceagent>\",\n  \"reason\": \"<one sentence explaining why>\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\" | \"medium\" | \"low\"\n}\n\nExamples:\nMessage: \"I need 10 HP laptops for Hyderabad office\" → { \"agentName\": \"catalogagent\", \"reason\": \"New purchase request — catalog search and cart creation needed\", \"confidence\": \"high\" }\nMessage: \"What is the status of my requisition REQ-001?\" → { \"agentName\": \"requisitionagent\", \"reason\": \"Asking about requisition status\", \"confidence\": \"high\" }\nMessage: \"The laptops have arrived, all 10 received\" → { \"agentName\": \"goodsreceiptagent\", \"reason\": \"Confirming delivery of goods\", \"confidence\": \"high\" }\nMessage: \"Process the invoice for PO-001\" → { \"agentName\": \"invoiceagent\", \"reason\": \"Invoice creation and processing requested\", \"confidence\": \"high\" }"
          },
          {
            "id": "router-usr-001",
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Buyer message: {{system.userQuery}}\n\nDetermine the correct agent and return the JSON."
          }
        ],
        "tools": [],
        "resources": [],
        "libraries": [],
        "maxIterations": 1,
        "structuredOutput": {
          "enable": true,
          "name": "RouterDecision",
          "description": "Which P2P agent to route this message to",
          "schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "agentName": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "catalogagent",
                  "requisitionagent",
                  "orderagent",
                  "goodsreceiptagent",
                  "invoiceagent"
                ]
              },
              "reason": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "confidence": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "high",
                  "medium",
                  "low"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "agentName",
              "reason",
              "confidence"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
